If you installed watsonx Orchestrate Developer Edition before ADK version 2.0, remove all containers before upgrading. Run orchestrate server reset to clear them. The Developer Edition no longer depends on an external container engine. If you skip the reset, you create multiple installations that consume unnecessary system resources and cause port conflicts.
